        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Loc Je-kɔb kä Beth-ɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ cu Kuoth Je-kɔb cu jiök i̱, “Jiɛcni kä ɣo̱thni Beth-ɛl, kä wër teni thi̱n, kä wër täthni ɣä yi̱k thi̱n, ɣän Kuoth ëë nyuth rɔ ji̱ runä mëë bari rɔ kɛ dämuɔɔr ni E-thɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ nɔ, cu Je-kɔb ji̱ cieeŋdɛ kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tëë tekɛ jɛ kɛɛl cu jiök i̱, “Yɛn yia̱kɛ jɔɔk diaal tëë cia nööŋ kɛ yɛ kɛɛl röli kɔ̱kiɛn, kä jakɛ pua̱nykun kä gɔw, kä ruɔnyɛ rɔ̱ kɛ bieyni ti puɔth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä banɛ cu wä Beth-ɛl, kä ɛn thɔ̱ŋi ɣän bä Kuoth ëë ci palä liŋ guäth ëë ta̱a̱ rɛy rikä kä ci ɣä Ja̱a̱l rɛy jälikä diaal wä ta̱th yi̱k.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cukɛ kolaaŋkiɛn cu nöŋ Je-kɔb amäni tiil kuthnikiɛn tëë ca la̱th ji̱thnikiɛn. Kä cu Je-kɔb kɛ tɛ̈t piny thaar jiaath lua̱l in te gekä Cɛ-kɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ɣöthkɛ, cu Kuoth ji̱ wi̱i̱ni tin thie̱e̱k kɛ kɛ kuer dual mi di̱i̱t a /ke̱nkɛ Je-kɔb kɛnɛ ji̱ cieeŋdɛ lɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Je-kɔb kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal cop kä Luudh (min la Beth-ɛl) rɛy rööl Kɛ-naan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ cop, cuɛ yi̱k täth thi̱n, kä cuɛ gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ ca̱k ciöt i̱ Ɛl-beth-ɛl,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛl-beth-ɛl",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö Kuoth Beth-ɛl.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kɛ ɣöö ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ëë kɔŋ Kuoth rɔɔdɛ nyuɔ̱th jɛ thi̱n runä mëë barɛ rɔ kɛ däman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä guäth ëë tekɛ kä Beth-ɛl cu Dɛ-bo-ra mëë la läät ciëŋ Rɛ-bɛ-ka li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony thaar jiaath lua̱l gekä Beth-ɛl. Ɛ jɛn cua jiath ɛmɔ cu cɔl i̱ A-lon-ba-kuth (min lot ni ɣöö jiath wi̱i̱kä.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mëë ci Je-kɔb luny jɔk kä Pa-dan-a-ram, cu Kuoth rɔ nyɔk kɛ nyuth jɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ poth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Cɔalkɛ ciötdu i̱ Je-kɔb, kä a tɛmɛ ni ɛn walɛ a ji̱ /ca nyɔk kɛ ciöt i̱ Je-kɔb, kä a ciötdu la I-thɛ-rɛl.” Kä cua ciötdɛ cu cɔl i̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Kuoth ɛ ku jiök i̱, “Ɛ ɣän Kuoth in le̱ny buɔ̱mdɛ ti diaal, di̱eth rɔ kä a kuayku rëpkɛ rɔ̱, kä ɛpuc bikɛ a mat dööri ti ŋuan, kä bi rɛydiɛn tekɛ kua̱r ti di̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn mun ëë cä ka̱m A-bɛ-ram kɛnɛ Ay-dhɛk, ɣän bä, ka̱m ji̱ kä bä jɛ ka̱m kuayku tin ba ji̱ guɔ̱ɔ̱r bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cu Kuoth cu jiɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Je-kɔb päm ti̱mä cu cuŋ ɛn guäth ëë ci Kuoth ruac thi̱n kɛ jɛ, kä cuɛ wi̱cdɛ ti̱eth kɔaŋ kɛnɛ liɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ cɔl i̱ Beth-ɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Da̱p Ben-ya-min kɛnɛ lia̱a̱ Re-cɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cukɛ cu ɣöth kä Beth-ɛl. Kä mëë cikɛ Ɛp-rath ŋäth ikä, cua Re-cɛl käp ɛ mäc, cuɛ dap kɛ dap mi bɛc bɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä guäth in tëë kɛ mäc cu gääm ɛ jiök i̱, “Cu dual, kɛ ɣöö ɛ gat dhöl ɛnɔ bi nyɔk kɛ da̱p ɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wee kɛ mi muɔ̱nɛ cuɛ ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Bɛn-oni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bɛn-oni kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö gat pärädä.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", kä cu gua̱n ɛ cɔl i̱ Ben-ya-min",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ben-ya-min kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö gat cuëëcdä.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Re-cɛl cu li̱w kä cua jɛ kony däär ɔ wäkädiɛn Ɛp-rath (min la Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Je-kɔb päm ti̱mä la̱th wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱ndɛ, amäni täämɛ nɔmɔ ɛ jɛn päm in nyoth gua̱a̱th muɔ̱ɔ̱n Re-cɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu I-thɛ-rɛl ja̱lɛ cuɔ̱p kä cuɛ wä pua̱t kui̱c Mig-dal-edɛr.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciööt gan Je-kɔb",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guäth ëë tëë ɛn dhɔɔr ɛmɔ, cu Rɛ-u-ben Bila min la luɔm gua̱n ka̱n. Kä cu I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ liŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je-kɔb tëë kɛ gaat da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaat ciekdɛ ni Leya ɛ Rɛ-u-ben min la kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ Je-kɔb, kɛ Cim-on kɛ Lii-bay kɛ Juda kɛ Yi-tha-kar kɛnɛ Dhɛ-bu-lun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
